nciple","source_ref":"core/organ_atlas.json::organs[verifier_lab_kernel].principle_refs"},{"basis":"authored_atlas_row","component_id":"world_model_projection_drift_control_room","ref_kind":"principle","source_ref":"core/organ_atlas.json::organs[world_model_projection_drift_control_room].principle_refs"}],"cited_by_count":42,"component_ids":["batch10_cold_eval_honesty_capsule","batch10_governance_compilers_capsule","batch10_live_source_drift_capsule","batch11_saturation_engines_capsule","batch12_market_dashboard_read_model_capsule","batch12_prediction_market_board_capsule","batch4_proof_authority_runtime","batch5_authority_systems_capsule","batch6_unsurfaced_primitives_capsule","batch7_demo_take_console_capsule","batch7_macro_engines_capsule","batch7_oracle_sibling_capsule","batch7_secondary_runtime_capsule","batch8_audio_level_rms_port","batch8_compliance_pipeline_capsule","batch8_policy_engines_capsule","batch8_structural_theses_capsule","batch8_tools_tail_primitives_capsule","batch8_validator_checker_capsule","batch9_macro_engines_capsule","bounded_autonomy_campaign_packet","bridge_phase_continuity_runtime","cognitive_operator_registry","cold_reader_route_map","durable_agent_work_landing_replay","engine_room_demo","executable_doctrine_grammar","macro_projection_import_protocol","materials_chemistry_closed_loop_lab_safety_replay","navigation_hologram_route_plane","pattern_assimilation_step","pattern_binding_contract","proof_diagnostic_evidence_spine","public_reveal_walkthrough","research_replication_rubric_artifact_replay","routing_anti_patterns_registry","self_ignorance_coverage_ledger","spatial_world_model_counterfactual_simulation_replay","standards_meta_diagnostics","verifier_lab_execution_spine","verifier_lab_kernel","world_model_projection_drift_control_room"],"exposed_count":0,"exposure":[],"failure_modes":[],"id":"P-15","kind":"principle","plain":"Generated docs, markdown summaries, route cards and paper modules may present what the source says and may never raise it. When the source content, the grammar or the source's status no longer supports a generated page, recompute the page from the source or lower its status.","principles":[],"reader":{"analogy":{"boundary":"The photocopy covers only a copy ranking below its original; it leaves out that a generated page is limited by several source properties at once, such as freshness and origin.","maps":[{"analogy":"the signed original contract","doctrine":"the source"},{"analogy":"the photocopy that can be read and cannot overrule the original","doctrine":"the generated page kept at or below its source"},{"analogy":"the old copy stops counting once the original is amended","doctrine":"regenerate or downgrade when the source weakens"}],"text":"A photocopy of a contract can be read and shared, and the signed original still decides. When the original is amended, the old copy stops counting."},"basis":"authored_reader_enrichment","counterexample":"A polished summary page is cited as the authority for a number after the source it was generated from has changed.","does_not_prove":"Keeping a generated page below its source stops the page adding authority and does nothing to make the source correct.","enforced_in_component_ids":["macro_projection_import_protocol","world_model_projection_drift_control_room"],"example":{"component_ids":["macro_projection_import_protocol"],"text":"The source-import protocol brings public material in with a manifest and a hash for each file, and the imported copy is never allowed to outrank the original it was copied from."},"governs":"The relation between a source and the pages generated from it.","plain":"A generated page can display what a source says, but it carries no more authority than that source. If the source weakens, the page has to be regenerated or marked down.","potential_misread":"That a clear, confident-looking page must be reliable, when it can only be as reliable as its source.","refuses":"A generated page, card or summary that claims more than the source it summarizes.","requires":"Keeping a generated page at or below its source's support, freshness, origin and grammar check, and regenerating or downgrading it when any of those weakens.","source_ref":"core/doctrine_enrichment.json","why_it_matters":"A polished public page cannot be treated as more trustworthy than the source it was generated from."},"rests_on":["AX-4","AX-5","AX-11"],"source_ref":"PRINCIPLES.md::P-15","statement":"Grounding: AX-4, AX-5, AX-11.\nObligation grounding: AX-4.O1.content_basis_digest_declared, AX-4.O2.equal_basis_permits_reuse, AX-4.O3.digest_drift_forces_recompute, AX-4.O4.freshness_basis_mismatch_materialized, AX-5.O1.composite_status_meets_parts, AX-5.O2.no_evidence_defaults_blocked, AX-5.O3.authority_cannot_raise_without_derivation, AX-11.O1.grammar_membership_required, AX-11.O2.receipts_and_anti_claims_present, AX-11.O3.prose_alone_is_projection.\n\nGenerated docs, markdown summaries, route cards and paper modules may present\nwhat the source says and may never raise it. When the source content, the\ngrammar or the source's status no longer supports a generated page, recompute\nthe page from the source or lower its status.","statement_sha256":"d05f85421cead39ee4409fb9ee2f2fdb31512f941c24a21d118c816b9a2e65f9","title":"Keep projections below source authority","violates":[]},"schema_version":"plectis_component_http_v1","snapshot_revision":"45be1deb333ad57cd9ae093229455d0a52d3bf23a9064cde09f1a6e16f4c7044"}